{"id":"62c13ef1c5cb9a73","group":"18","path":"18/18-thm-cut-elim.md","title":"有限切秩的迭代消除","display":"thm-cut-elim — 有限切秩的迭代消除","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-thm-cut-elim","aliases":["18-thm-cut-elim"],"display":"thm-cut-elim — 有限切秩的迭代消除","depends_on":["[[18-thm-one-step-cut-elimination]]","[[18-df-omega-tower]]","[[18-df-semiformal-derivability]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"derived from Lemma 7.3.13; compare Theorem 7.3.15","source_pages":"115–116","source_pdf_pages":"125–126","verification_status":"source-derived-corollary-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-thm-cut-elim"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-thm-cut-elim</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cut-elim — 有限切秩的迭代消除"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fca2fdd37fa20a53\" href=\"?note=fca2fdd37fa20a53\" title=\"18-thm-one-step-cut-elimination\">18-thm-one-step-cut-elimination</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fdee91a683a5c7c3\" href=\"?note=fdee91a683a5c7c3\" title=\"18-df-omega-tower\">18-df-omega-tower</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8accc2f8cbc49eab\" href=\"?note=8accc2f8cbc49eab\" title=\"18-df-semiformal-derivability\">18-df-semiformal-derivability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"derived from Lemma 7.3.13; compare Theorem 7.3.15"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"115–116"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"125–126"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-derived-corollary-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&lt;\\omega\">\\(n&lt;\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8accc2f8cbc49eab\" href=\"?note=8accc2f8cbc49eab\" title=\"18-df-semiformal-derivability\">18-df-semiformal-derivability</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_n(\\alpha)\">\\(\\omega_n(\\alpha)\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fdee91a683a5c7c3\" href=\"?note=fdee91a683a5c7c3\" title=\"18-df-omega-tower\">18-df-omega-tower</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_n^\\alpha(\\Delta)\\ \\longrightarrow\\ D_0^{\\omega_n(\\alpha)}(\\Delta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_n^\\alpha(\\Delta)\\ \\longrightarrow\\ D_0^{\\omega_n(\\alpha)}(\\Delta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对 n 归纳。n=0 时为恒等。n+1 时先用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fca2fdd37fa20a53\" href=\"?note=fca2fdd37fa20a53\" title=\"18-thm-one-step-cut-elimination\">18-thm-one-step-cut-elimination</a> 得到 D_n<sup>{ω</sup>α}，再用归纳假设；有限迭代满足 ω_n(ω^α)=ω_{n+1}(α)。n=0 已包含在断言中。结论只涉及已定义的 NT 半形式系统。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-thm-one-step-cut-elimination","status":"resolved","id":"fca2fdd37fa20a53","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-thm-one-step-cut-elimination]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-omega-tower","status":"resolved","id":"fdee91a683a5c7c3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-omega-tower]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-semiformal-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"8accc2f8cbc49eab","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-semiformal-derivability]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-semiformal-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"8accc2f8cbc49eab","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$n<\\omega$，$\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{<\\omega}$；$D$ 按 [[18-df-semiformal-derivability]]，$\\omega_n(\\alpha)$ 按 [[18-df-omega-tower]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-omega-tower","status":"resolved","id":"fdee91a683a5c7c3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$n<\\omega$，$\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{<\\omega}$；$D$ 按 [[18-df-semiformal-derivability]]，$\\omega_n(\\alpha)$ 按 [[18-df-omega-tower]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-thm-one-step-cut-elimination","status":"resolved","id":"fca2fdd37fa20a53","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"对 n 归纳。n=0 时为恒等。n+1 时先用 [[18-thm-one-step-cut-elimination]] 得到 D_n^{ω^α}，再用归纳假设；有限迭代满足 ω_n(ω^α)=ω_{n+1}(α)。n=0 已包含在断言中。结论只涉及已定义的 NT 半形式系统。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"n<\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_n(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"D_n^\\alpha(\\Delta)\\ \\longrightarrow\\ D_0^{\\omega_n(\\alpha)}(\\Delta).","display":true}],"bytes":1171,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-103","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-thm-cut-elim]]"},{"id":"a44f2e4245074d